  "TRI_HV1": {
   "status": "REQUIRED",
   "rule": "per quad (a,b,c,d): split A = (a,b,c)+(a,c,d), split B = (a,b,d)+(b,c,d); 1. smaller fold between the two triangle normals if the folds differ by > 0.5 deg; 2. else larger minimum triangle angle if > 0.5 deg apart; 3. else shorter diagonal (> 1e-9 cm); 4. else the diagonal holding the smallest vertex index; 5. intersection validation over rest + the 8 head / neck poses (ear neighbourhood 14 cm, triangle pairs touching the branch, no shared vertex): greedy flips in frozen quad order, kept only if the total crossing count drops, until stable. Triangles keep the quad winding.",
   "requirements": [
    "use the baked triangle choices recorded per member (baked/*_TRI-HV1.npz; triangle hashes above)",
    "never export quads / never let an importer choose diagonals",
    "preserve the step-5 crossing-resolution diagonals",
    "production exports carry the baked triangles downstream"
   ],
